flowchart TD
  S["State s, take action a"] --> OB["Observe r and s′"]
  OB --> T{{"Target"}}
  T -->|"Q-learning (off-policy)"| QL["r + γ · max over a′ of Q(s′, a′)"]
  T -->|"SARSA (on-policy)"| SA["r + γ · Q(s′, a′)<br/>a′ = the action actually taken"]
  QL --> U["Q(s, a) += α · (target − Q(s, a))"]
  SA --> U
  U --> NEXT["Move to s′, repeat every step"]
